昆曲\" [level=1] [ref=e694]\n            - paragraph [ref=e695]: Kunqu Opera\n            - generic [ref=e696]:\n              - generic [ref=e697]:\n                - img [ref=e698]\n                - generic [ref=e701]: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n              - generic [ref=e702]:\n                - img [ref=e703]\n                - generic [ref=e705]: 2001年入选\n            - paragraph [ref=e707]: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，起源于元末明初的昆山腔，距今已有六百多年历史。昆曲被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，对中国其他戏曲剧种产生了深远影响。昆曲音乐优美婉转，表演细腻典雅，文辞讲究，具有很高的文学价值。《牡丹亭》《长生殿》《桃花扇》等经典剧目流传至今，仍然打动着观众。2001年，昆曲被联合国教科文组织列入首批\"人类口头和非物质遗产代表作\"，成为中国第一个入选的项目。\n            - generic [ref=e708]:\n              - button \"返回全景探索\" [ref=e709] [cursor=pointer]\n              - link \"浏览更多项目\" [ref=e710] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /#categories\n    - contentinfo [ref=e711]:\n      - generic [ref=e712]:\n        - generic [ref=e713]:\n          - generic [ref=e714]:\n            - generic [ref=e715]:\n              - generic [ref=e717]: 遗\n              - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=3] [ref=e719]\n            - paragraph [ref=e720]: 致力于保护和传承中国非物质文化遗产，让千年文化在数字时代焕发新的生机。\n          - generic [ref=e721]:\n            - heading \"探索分类\" [level=4] [ref=e722]\n            - list [ref=e723]:\n              - listitem [ref=e724]:\n                - link \"传统工艺\" [ref=e725] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e726]:\n                - link \"传统表演\" [ref=e727] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e728]:\n                - link \"民俗活动\" [ref=e729] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e730]:\n                - link \"传统美术\" [ref=e731] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n          - generic [ref=e732]:\n            - heading \"了解更多\" [level=4] [ref=e733]\n            - list [ref=e734]:\n              - listitem [ref=e735]:\n                - link \"关于我们\" [ref=e736] [cursor=pointe